    "Name": "Canis II 1",
    "Details": "The Canis II weapons loadout includes paired ER Large Lasers, several Medium Pulse Lasers, and iATM launchers, offering a flexible and deadly combination. Missile ammunition is protected by CASE II, helping prevent internal damage in the event of a critical hit. Due to the high cost of materials and recurring issues with the reinforced frame, the Canis II sees only limited deployment among Clan units.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Sensors</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.2</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Lower</color>\n\n<b><color=#0064e6>Used with permission from Aries Games and Miniatures.</color></b>",
